{# Watching-zenoh RFC §5.2 — author-declared driver headers.
   Each top-level `<sce:driver href="..."/>` on the SCXML root is
   resolved at compile-model time (`resolve_driver_refs` /
   `resolve_driver_refs_with_root` in `sce-build/src/lib.rs`) against
   either the SCXML file's parent directory (the default)
   or `deploy.yaml`'s `platform.driver_root` (override). The resolver
   confirms file existence only; cross-TU symbol verification is
   delegated to the C compiler. Empty `driver_refs`
   skips the loop entirely so the byte-stable output of every existing
   fixture stays unchanged. #}
{%- for d in model.driver_refs %}
#include "{{ d.resolved_path or d.href }}"
{%- endfor %}

