    /* W3C SCXML 3.6 + 3.4: top-down chain enter. Each compound chain
       element runs its `<initial>` transition's executable content
       between its own onentry and its child's onentry (test412 —
       actions interleave at the parent/child boundary). Each parallel
       chain element activates its sibling regions before the chain
       descends past it (test413/364/576 — multi-target initial enters
       every sibling region, not just the path of model.initial_leaf).
